@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000

### 1. Ro'yxat
GET {{baseUrl}}/items/

### 2. Yaratish
POST {{baseUrl}}/items/
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Olma", "price": 12000}

### 3. Qisman yangilash
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/items/1
Content-Type: application/json

{"price": 9000}

### 4. Noto'g'ri ma'lumot (422 kutamiz)
POST {{baseUrl}}/items/
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "A", "price": -1}

### 5. O'chirish
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/items/1

